  "reviewNote": "Reviewed 2026-09-11 at commit 356918eb. Vendored subset: manifest, six skills, six Codex-format commands, the three lifecycle hooks and the five JS modules they require, plus LICENSE (MIT). Excluded: assets, benchmarks, tests, translated READMEs, the MCP server, and the packaging for other agents. The hook scripts make no network calls and spawn no processes; they read and write a mode file under the per-user config directory and honour CLAUDE_CONFIG_DIR, so the mode follows FDE's per-account profile isolation rather than being global.",
